From 85b6a426bb24527a5fab54a4f32a3367727f9cd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:28:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dsgx.h: a small header-only 3D library for the DS 3D chip
 (matrices, lights, materials, culling, meshes, vsync), dsgx_win.h
 desktop-window helper; dsgl3d and the console dsgx rewritten on it; dsgl3d
 takes the keyboard focus and always shows 'a:aa c:cull' state

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
